From cd5168c48b5422a50829259fd43e84cc3edd6694 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hao Lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:42:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [llvm-profgen] Normalize GNU AS Thumb DWARF addresses in IP
 mode

Normalize odd Thumb DWARF ranges only with executable mapping-symbol evidence. Query the same instruction alias at normalized range starts, retaining the original PC and checking leaf file, line and discriminator consistency. Report normalization and alias evidence; preserve non-IP behavior.

Add GNU AS fixtures for tagged ranges, adjacent functions and synthetic line inconsistencies. Keep shared symbolizer libraries and sampled PCs unchanged.
