 ``semantics.zero_fill`` (string)
   none or sampled-functions; these are literal policy names, not absence markers.
 
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.range_count`` (string | uint64)
+  Number of loaded DWARF function ranges normalized, not a sample count.
+  Unknown before function loading/generation. IP ELF32 little-endian ARM only:
+  when an odd lower bound with bit zero cleared is in an executable section's
+  Thumb mapping interval, both range endpoints have bit zero cleared. This
+  affects classification and boundary enumeration, never sampled PCs or LBR.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization`` (object)
+  Evidence for GNU AS Thumb-tagged DWARF addresses.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.alias_query_count`` (uint64)
+  Number of IP symbolization cache misses that used a normalized start's N+1
+  alias. Samples, counters and cache keys retain N. Zero before any such query.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.alias_check_passed`` (uint64)
+  Alias queries whose leaf file, line and discriminator exactly match the
+  original address query. A mismatch fails the whole conversion at generate.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.alias_addresses_top50`` (array)
+  First 50 queried addresses in ascending ELF virtual address order. Empty
+  means no alias query. Raw query results are retained for consistency auditing.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.alias_addresses_top50[]`` (object)
+  One same-instruction alias query and its consistency check.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.alias_addresses_top50[].address`` (uint64)
+  Original sample or enumerated instruction address N, in ELF VA bytes.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.alias_addresses_top50[].alias`` (uint64)
+  Original tagged DWARF lower bound N+1 used only for symbolization.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.alias_addresses_top50[].consistent`` (bool)
+  Whether both queries yielded a leaf with identical file, line, discriminator.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.alias_addresses_top50[].original_query`` (string)
+  Raw frame fields from querying N (function, file, line, discriminator,
+  declaration line). No function-name fallback or source-position guessing.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.alias_addresses_top50[].alias_query`` (string)
+  Raw frame fields from querying N+1. After a successful consistency check,
+  this frame chain supplies the profile identity, including adjacent functions.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.top50`` (string | array)
+  First 50 normalized ranges sorted by function, original begin, original end.
+  Unknown before loading/generation; an empty array means none were normalized.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.top50[]`` (object)
+  One normalized function range, with half-open byte addresses in ELF VA space.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.top50[].function`` (string)
+  DWARF function name.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.top50[].original_begin`` (uint64)
+  Original DWARF lower bound, in bytes.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.top50[].original_end`` (uint64)
+  Original DWARF upper bound, in bytes.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.top50[].begin`` (uint64)
+  Normalized inclusive ELF virtual address, in bytes.
+
+``thumb_dwarf_normalization.top50[].end`` (uint64)
+  Normalized exclusive ELF virtual address, in bytes.
+
 ``throttle`` (string)
   Unknown: throttle records are not part of the admitted text grammar.
 
@@ -1422,6 +1546,10 @@ Warning codes
 ``W_DUPLICATE_FUNCTION_START``
